## Precomputed/bundled-reference artifacts (data/preloaded/**): *.rds/*.RData/*.rda
## above already cover the R objects, but several large precomputed CSV/gz/xlsx
## tables in this tree (e.g. the ~250MB of methylomics DMP full-results tables)
## were never matched by any rule and were sitting as plain, undeltified git
## blobs - inconsistent with every sibling .rds artifact in the same pipeline
## (2026-09-07 defense audit, Git LFS / clean-clone reproducibility finding).
